Package: hiraeth
Type: Package
Title: Colour Palettes Sampled from Photographs of Wales
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Gemma", "Rees", email = "gemmarees7@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Colour palettes sampled from photographs of places in Wales -
    Eryri, Barafundle, Tenby, Rhossili and Portmeirion - with 'ggplot2'
    scales and a helper to build new palettes from your own photographs.
    'Hiraeth' is a Welsh word for a longing for home.
